{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mecha Force&quot; is a first-person mecha action game. Pilot the gigantic KYLIN in a chaotic future and face the Dominators, the ultimate threat to humanity. The fate of the world depends on your skills as a mecha pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maki will serve as your navigator, control the steel giant KYLIN, and fight to reclaim the future of humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Mecha Force&quot; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Fusion with Mecha Action in the Union System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel one with the giant robot as you climb into the cockpit and face the Dominators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Customization Options for Your Robot </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the multiple options to customize your KYLIN mecha to your heart's desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Battles in a Roguelike System with Random Maps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game's roguelike system, complete with random maps that expand gameplay possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeutralLink-Navigator </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious Machineera (Maki) can connect with KYLIN through the Neutral Link. She will accompany you in battles, helping you as your navigator.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036130?t=1758787576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/35d9e59fe88b7858a63a2811400107bf5cf4bf99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758787576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758787576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758787576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mecha Force&quot; is a first-person mecha action game. Pilot the gigantic KYLIN in a chaotic future and face the Dominators, the ultimate threat to humanity. The fate of the world depends on your skills as a mecha pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maki will serve as your navigator, control the steel giant KYLIN, and fight to reclaim the future of humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Mecha Force&quot; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Fusion with Mecha Action in the Union System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel one with the giant robot as you climb into the cockpit and face the Dominators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Customization Options for Your Robot </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the multiple options to customize your KYLIN mecha to your heart's desire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Battles in a Roguelike System with Random Maps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game's roguelike system, complete with random maps that expand gameplay possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeutralLink-Navigator </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious Machineera (Maki) can connect with KYLIN through the Neutral Link. She will accompany you in battles, helping you as your navigator.</p>","developers":["MING STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/